": "Alex realizes that stories he builds become the light that fills the void.", "at": 0.25}, {"who": "demon", "text": "What remains when there is none?", "at": 0.5, "style": "bubble"}], "narration_index": 1}, {"dur": 3, "set": "scene", "camera": {"frame": "close", "on": "alex", "push": 0.07}, "actors": [{"id": "alex", "x": 30, "pose": "stand", "mood": "curiosity", "facing": 1}], "lines": [{"who": "alex", "text": "Stories I build light the void.", "at": 0.4, "style": "thought"}]}], "2": [{"dur": 8.396938775510204, "set": "kitchen", "time": "morning", "grade": "warm", "camera": {"frame": "medium", "push": 0.05}, "actors": [{"id": "sam", "x": 30, "pose": "stand", "mood": "thoughtful", "facing": 1}, {"id": "alex", "x": 70, "pose": "watch", "mood": "thoughtful", "facing": -1}], "narration_index": 0, "lines": [{"who": "narrator", "text": "Sam explains that meaning isn’t discovered but built, like stacking words into a story we choose to live.", "at": 0.25}]}, {"dur": 6.356122448979591, "set": "kitchen", "time": "morning", "grade": "warm", "camera": {"frame": "close", "on": "alex", "push": 0.04}, "actors": [{"id": "alex", "x": 70, "pose": "watch", "mood": "thoughtful", "facing": -1}, {"id": "sam", "x": 30, "pose": "pour", "mood": "thoughtful", "facing": 1}], "narration_index": 1, "lines": [{"who": "narrator", "text": "Alex watches the steam rise, realizing each breath can become a deliberate chapter.", "at": 0.25}]}], "3": [{"dur": 8.805102040816326, "set": "kitchen", "time": "morning", "grade": "warm", "camera": {"frame": "medium", "push": 0.05}, "actors": [{"id": "alex", "x": 70, "pose": "stand", "mood": "hopeful", "facing": -1}, {"id": "sam", "x": 30, "pose": "stand", "mood": "hopeful", "facing": 1}], "narration_index": 0, "lines": [{"who": "narrator", "text": "Alex asks how a fleeting hobby can feel lasting, and Sam replies that personal projects anchor our self‑crafted purpose.", "at": 0.25}]}, {"dur": 7.172448979591836, "set": "kitchen", "time": "morning", "grade": 