ilence, challenging the value of even the smallest act of creation.", "at": 0.3, "style": "float"}]}, {"dur": 10.845918367346938, "set": "void", "time": "night", "weather": "none", "grade": "cold", "camera": {"frame": "close", "push": 0.06}, "actors": [{"id": "alex", "x": 50, "pose": "stand", "mood": "determined", "facing": -1}, {"id": "demon", "x": 30, "pose": "lean", "mood": "neutral", "facing": 1}], "narration_index": 2, "lines": [{"who": "narrator", "text": "Alex’s reply echoes the quiet resolve that, though the cosmos is indifferent, the act of choosing to create is a meaningful act in itself.", "at": 0.25}, {"who": "alex", "text": "Alex’s reply echoes the quiet resolve that, though the cosmos is indifferent, the act of choosing to create is a meaningful act in itself.", "at": 0.4, "style": "float"}]}], "7": [{"dur": 10.0, "set": "park", "time": "day", "weather": "gentle", "grade": "warm", "camera": {"frame": "wide", "push": 0.04}, "actors": [{"id": "alex", "x": 40, "pose": "stand", "mood": "hopeful", "facing": 1}], "narration_index": 0, "lines": [{"who": "narrator", "text": "On a sun‑dappled bench, Alex spreads a sketchpad and begins tracing a blooming seedling.", "at": 0.25}]}, {"dur": 10.0, "set": "park", "time": "day", "weather": "gentle", "grade": "warm", "camera": {"frame": "medium", "on": "alex", "push": 0.05}, "actors": [{"id": "alex", "x": 45, "pose": "type", "mood": "hopeful", "facing": 1}], "lines": [{"who": "narrator", "text": "Each line stitches meaning into the air, turning idle time into quiet fulfillment.", "at": 0.25}, {"who": "alex", "text": "…", "style": "float", "at": 0.3}], "narration_index": 1}], "8": [{"dur": 7.0, "set": "park", "time": "day", "weather": "gentle", "grade": "warm", "camera": {"frame": "wide", "push": 0.05}, "actors": [{"id": "alex", "x": 30, "pose": "stand", "mood": "hopeful"}, {"id": "sam", "x": 70, "pose": "stand", "mood": "hopeful"}], "narration_index": 0, "lines": [{"who": "narrator", "text": "Alex invites Sam to the b